
# `location` is also the universal whereabouts belief label: {X location Y}
# reads "X is/was at place Y" for both props (the building a prop sits in) and
# people (the dated where-were-you memory). The explicit (tar ?) keeps the
# auto-registered state target UNCONSTRAINED - a venue may be a building, a
# room/space, or a mental org object - instead of defaulting to the noun's own
# waypoint/spawnpoint subkinds (which would trip (tar) enforcement).
location (+ obs) (tar ?)
    waypoint
    spawnpoint
